{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"kinetic-energy-calculator UI copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","detected_language":"es","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"kinetic-energy-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","keys":["kinetic-energy-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer"],"locale":"es","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"La energía potencial se mide en relación a una altura de referencia que elijas, una posición por debajo de ese nivel cero tiene mgh negativo; esto no significa que el objeto tenga masa negativa o que la energía cinética sea negativa.","record_id":"0e3927b5e72468cfcedc2ba473c29dab8277374662b8b6da36b72a9ebb0db7f1","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":1.2810157988750461,"source":"Potential energy is measured relative to a reference height that you choose. A position below that zero level has negative mgh; this does not mean the object has negative mass or that kinetic energy is negative.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"47c034bfe6a75d5cba016c4ec67b6a4b096ec1098d6191a1ee7e1a1d4e4b73cb","status":"machine-draft","translation":"La energía potencial se mide en relación a una altura de referencia que elijas, una posición por debajo de ese nivel cero tiene mgh negativo; esto no significa que el objeto tenga masa negativa o que la energía cinética sea negativa.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
